---
source: crates/telec-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: extracted
---
  create     Create a new todo backed by its required `input` artifact
  list       List todo entries (source of truth for todo status)
  design     Run the creative state machine (deferred to v1)
  co-create  Deprecated alias for `telec todo design` (deferred to v1)
  remove     Remove a todo and its todo entry
  freeze     Move a todo to the icebox
  unfreeze   Promote a todo from the icebox to the active todo list
  deliver    Move a todo to delivered
  prepare    Run the Phase A (prepare) state machine (deferred to v1)
  work       Run the Phase B (work) state machine (deferred to v1)
  integrate  Run the Phase C (integrate) state machine (deferred to v1)
  set-deps   Set dependencies for a work item in the todo list
  dump       Fire-and-forget brain dump (deferred to v1)
  split      Split a todo into child items (deferred to v1)
  stamp      Stamp a verdict or readiness marker (deferred to v1)
  show       Show the full state payload for a todo
  artifacts  Manage todo artifacts in the database
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
